SUMMARY:Impromptu - HR D-Signed for Lunch 18R
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nSweep: open\n\nAverage Pa
 ce 14-16 mph\n\nThis ride has no Ride with GPS file. Join me to create one
  by riding it.\nCue Sheet: [Old School Cue Sheet](https://routes.lancaster
 bikeclub.net/cue/county-line-28h/)\n\nAfter the ride for a beverage or foo
 d. Hennigan's is not open\; TBD\n\nRide leader will ride at the advertised
  average speed\, unless at the back. This is intended to be a no-drop grou
 p ride. You can ride ahead if you want to.\n\nHelmets are mandatory\; plea
 se also plan to bring 1-2 water bottles\, and basic repair kit (spare tube
 \, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\nBeing a Meetup Member does not mean 
 you are a club member. Use this [link to join](https://www.lancasterbikecl
 ub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148) the club.\nYour RSVP is you
 r agreement to abide by the club's [Code of Conduct](https://lancbikeclub.
 clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984) a
 nd [Rules of the Road](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?p
 age_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159)
