SUMMARY:CoffeeTue- LV New Holland Coffee Company (30R) -- RSVP required
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide Leader: Bruce Black\
 n\nCoffeeTue rides:\n• A rotating start location\, not a school\n• A p
 redetermined route\n• 25+/- mile routes\n• 13 to 15 mph average pace\n
 • Usually no sweep\n• “short” stop for refreshment/coffee mid-rout
 e at [Coffee Company Cafe](https://www.newhollandcoffee.com/) in New Holla
 nd\nThe CoffeeTue rides are social rides\, but cyclists are not expected t
 o stay in one group. Cyclists may pedal at their own comfortable paces. Pl
 ease be supportive of the other cyclists to avoid anyone biking alone or b
 eing dropped off the back of the last group.\n\nClick for [Ride with GPS](
 https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/lv-new-holland-coffee-company-30r
 /)\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No ear buds. Please bring water and a basic r
 epair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate 
 passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and
  Meetup RSVP below to join this ride.\n\nBeing on Meetup does not mean you
  are a club member. [Join here](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.
 aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148).\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide b
 y the club's [Code of Conduct](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/conten
 t.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984) \,\n[Rules of the Road]
 (https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=2571
 48&module_id=325159) \, and [Ride Waiver](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/do
 cs.ashx?id=454318)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3142808
 74/
